  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2 \u2014 Consultation booking \u00b7 Private dental practice\n\n**Boundary: automated proposal, human confirm above CHF 3000.**\nBelow roughly CHF 3,000 the work is single-visit restorative or hygiene that any diary slot can absorb, whereas above it you are almost always into implants, multi-unit prosthetics, aligner courses or staged perio-plus-restorative sequencing \u2014 treatments that need the treating dentist to confirm the plan, the staging and the chair time personally before anything is promised to the patient. Scored 3/2/4.\n\n### The measurable thing here is travel\nClustering by locality is the whole point. Travel minutes per treatment, before and after, is unambiguous and it converts directly to money \u2014 the easiest result in the whole project to defend.\n\nRecord the unclustered estimate too, or you have nothing to compare against. The **Cluster by locality** node writes both.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "4d8cb97f-2ed5-4cc1-9c2d-7cc90419e89a",
